examples.text:
At gaming, perhaps, I may win;
With cards I may take the flats in,
Or trundle false dice, and they’re nick’d:

I hear the noise about thy keel;
⁠I hear the bell struck in the night:
⁠I see the cabin-window bright;
I see the sailor at the wheel.

Now Heav’n in all her Glorie shon, and rowld
Her motions, as the great first-Movers hand
First wheeld thir course;
